                                    "name": "Visa",
                                    "text": "<p>Passengers must have a valid visa issued by the USA.</p>|<p>Passengers with an Authorization for Parole of an Alien into the United States (Form I-512) or an Authorization to Transport for Parole of a Noncitizen into the United States (Form I-512L) do not need a visa.</p>|<p>Passengers with an Employment Authorization Card (Form I-766) do not need a visa if endorsed \"Serves as I-512 Advance Parole\" or \"Valid for re-entry to US\".</p>",
